 Bovine Shuffle · USACO 2024 December, Silver P2
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Two integers: the count, and ⌊S/2⌋ modulo 10⁹+7.

  ### SAMPLE INPUT:

    4
    3 2 1 3
    5 1 7 2

  ### SAMPLE OUTPUT:

    3 6

  Positions 1, 2 and 3 stay occupied; S = 5 + 1 + 7 = 13 and ⌊13/2⌋ = 6.

  SCORING:

  • Inputs 2-5: N ≤ 100
  • Inputs 6-10: N ≤ 10³
  • Inputs 11-14: no additional constraints.

  Problem credits: Nick Wu
